Package: kicad
Version: @VERSION@
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: kicad-packages3d (= @VERSION@)
Conflicts: kicad-symbols, kicad-footprints, kicad-templates
Provides: kicad-symbols (= @VERSION@), kicad-footprints (= @VERSION@), kicad-templates (= @VERSION@)
Replaces: kicad-symbols, kicad-footprints, kicad-templates
Maintainer: Pete Dietl <petedietl@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://www.kicad.org
Description: Electronic schematic and PCB design software
 KiCad is a cross-platform suite for electronic design automation, covering
 schematic capture, PCB layout, gerber generation and 3D visualisation.
 .
 Built from source against this machine's system libraries, with symbol,
 footprint and project-template libraries included. Install the matching
 kicad-packages3d build for the 3D component models.
